    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"stop the performance\"? what does that even mean? it feels like there's no \"redirecting\" it. like, the thing that made me *me* was the pursuit. if i'm not that person, then what am i actually doing here? just wasting space for another 50 years?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
